  "id": "mimir-yggdrasil-saas",
  "name": "Mimir Labs — Yggdrasil ERP SaaS Subscription Agreement",
  "formNumber": "ML-SAAS",
  "description": "Mimir Labs internal subscription agreement template for Yggdrasil ERP. Pricing follows the published governed-operating-footprint formula: Annual License = $30,000 + ($10,000 × Footprint Score). Source-of-truth markdown: docs/legal/CONTRACT.md. Replaces the legacy generated contract.norn.json from the contract-builder tool.",
  "version": "2.0",
  "sourceType": "composed",
  "createdAt": "2026-04-30T00:00:00",
  "updatedAt": "2026-04-30T00:00:00",
  "author": "Mimir Labs LLC",
  "pageCount": 1,
  "body": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center;\">YGGDRASIL ERP — SOFTWARE-AS-A-SERVICE SUBSCRIPTION AGREEMENT</h1><p><b>Agreement No.:</b> <span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Agreement Number]</span></p><p><b>Effective Date:</b> <span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Effective Date]</span></p><p><b>BETWEEN:</b> Mimir Labs LLC (Harrisburg, Pennsylvania) (\"Provider\")</p><p><b>AND:</b> <span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Client Entity]</span> (\"Client\")</p><h2>1. Service</h2><p>Provider shall provide Client with access to and use of the Yggdrasil ERP platform (the \"Service\") during the Subscription Term, subject to the terms of this Agreement. The Service includes all ten Business Modules (CRM, Sales, Purchasing, Manufacturing, Warehouse, Finance, Projects, PLM, Quality, Service), the canonical state engine, the append-only audit log, the B2B Event Hub, the REST and WebSocket APIs, and the standard SLA. Authorized Users are unlimited at every pricing tier.</p><h2>2. No Per-Seat or Per-Module Pricing</h2><p>Provider does not offer per-seat or per-module pricing. The recurring annual subscription fee is computed exclusively from the Footprint Score formula in Schedule A. Client may add an unlimited number of Authorized Users without additional fee.</p><h2>3. Schedule A — Annual License Pricing</h2><p>The recurring annual subscription fee is computed from Provider's published Yggdrasil pricing formula:</p><p style=\"font-family:monospace; padding:8px; background:#f5f5f5; border:1px solid #ccc;\">Annual License = $30,000 + ($10,000 × Footprint Score)</p><h3>Footprint Score Worksheet</h3><table style=\"width:100%; border-collapse:collapse;\"><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px; text-align:left;\">Input</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px; text-align:left;\">Customer Value</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px; text-align:left;\">Points</th></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;\">Physical sites (1 point each, 1st included)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;\"><span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Sites]</span></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;\"><span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Site Points]</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;\">Legal entities (1 point per entity beyond 1st)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;\"><span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Entities]</span></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;\"><span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Entity Points]</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;\">Integrated systems (first 3 free; +1 each 4–8; +1 per pair thereafter)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;\"><span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Integrations]</span></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;\"><span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Integration Points]</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;\">Annual governed transitions (&lt;50K=0/50K-500K=2/500K-2M=4/2M-10M=7/10M+=10+)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;\"><span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Transitions]</span></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;\"><span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Transition Points]</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;\">Compliance posture (Ordinary=0/ISO=2/CMMC L2=3/FDA, CMMC L3, aerospace=4)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;\"><span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Compliance]</span></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;\"><span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Compliance Points]</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;\">SLA tier (Standard=0/Critical=2/Mission-Critical=4)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;\"><span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[SLA]</span></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;\"><span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[SLA Points]</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;\">Audit retention depth (3y=0/7y=1/10y=2/Indefinite=3)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;\"><span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Retention]</span></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;\"><span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Retention Points]</span></td></tr><tr style=\"background:#FFF3CD;\"><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;\"><b>Footprint Score (sum)</b></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;\"></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;\"><b><span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Footprint Score]</span></b></td></tr></table><p><b>Annual Subscription Fee:</b> $<span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Annual Subscription]</span> · <b>Pricing Band:</b> <span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Band]</span></p><h2>4. Schedule B — Activation</h2><p>One-time activation fee covers canonical model setup, tenant configuration, governance boundary definition, role design, initial workflows, migration planning, and validation testing. Ratatosk and Ragnarok engagements paid prior credit 1:1 against activation.</p><p><b>Activation Fee:</b> $<span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Activation Fee]</span> · <b>Prior Ratatosk/Ragnarok credit applied:</b> $<span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Credit Applied]</span> · <b>Net activation due:</b> $<span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Net Activation]</span></p><h2>5. Schedule D — Audit Authority (Optional)</h2><p>Each Audit Authority designation makes Yggdrasil the contractually warranted system of record for one named compliance regime. Provider commits to audit-readiness for the designation and accepts capped warranty exposure if a finding traces to a Yggdrasil failure (audit log gap, governed-transition failure, retention failure, etc.).</p><p><b>Designated regimes:</b> <span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Designated Regimes List]</span></p><p>Pricing: 1st regime included if Footprint Score ≥ 10 (otherwise $15K/yr) with $50K cap. 2nd–3rd: $15K/yr each, +$50K cap each. 4th+: $25K/yr each, +$100K cap each. Eligible: ISO 9001, AS9100, ISO 13485, ITAR, FDA 21 CFR Part 11, CMMC L2/L3, SOC 2, SOX, HIPAA. Each requires Provider engineering and legal sign-off.</p><p><b>Audit Authority annual fee:</b> $<span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Audit Authority Annual Fee]</span> · <b>Aggregate warranty cap:</b> $<span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Audit Authority Warranty Cap]</span></p><h2>6. Schedule C — Commercial Terms</h2><p><b>Subscription Term:</b> <span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Term]</span> · <b>Billing Frequency:</b> <span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Billing Frequency]</span></p><p>Billing discounts: Quarterly (3%), Annual (8%). Multi-year discounts negotiable.</p><h3>Total Contract Value (initial term)</h3><table style=\"width:100%; border-collapse:collapse;\"><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;\">Activation (net)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px; text-align:right;\">$<span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Net Activation TCV]</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;\">Annual Subscription</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px; text-align:right;\">$<span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Annual TCV]</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;\">Audit Authority annual</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px; text-align:right;\">$<span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[AA TCV]</span></td></tr><tr style=\"background:#FFF3CD;\"><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;\"><b>Total Contract Value (initial term)</b></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px; text-align:right;\"><b>$<span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Total Contract Value]</span></b></td></tr></table><h2>7. Tenant Isolation, Data Ownership, and Other Terms</h2><p>The full operative provisions of this Agreement (including Articles 1-15 governing definitions, license grant, implementation, term & termination, fees & payment, intellectual property, data ownership and portability, confidentiality, security & data protection, warranties, indemnification, limitation of liability, miscellaneous, and the SLA) are set forth in the source-of-truth markdown at docs/legal/CONTRACT.md. The Parties acknowledge they have reviewed the full text and that this Norn-format presentation is a digital-signing surface, not a substitute for the canonical document.</p><h2>Signatures</h2><table style=\"width:100%\"><tr><td style=\"width:50%; vertical-align:top;\"><p><b>PROVIDER — Mimir Labs LLC</b></p><p>Signature: ____________________________</p><p>Name: ____________________________</p><p>Title: ____________________________</p><p>Date: ____________________________</p></td><td style=\"width:50%; vertical-align:top;\"><p><b>CLIENT</b></p><p>Signature: ____________________________</p><p>Name: ____________________________</p><p>Title: ____________________________</p><p>Date: ____________________________</p></td></tr></table>",
  "fields": [
